Subject: Select native arithmetic for original graphics matrix helpers

Upstream-base: 9ca59d250587adc0436d08176bec3898aa790fa0

Compile the original NL math/vector helpers and RVL 4x4 matrix TU. Retain its
portable projection and inverse bodies, add scalar native implementations of
its assembly-only primitives, and keep console assembly untouched. Native
inverse rejects singular inputs before changing its output. Use real Aurora
quaternion C functions and a portable native memory zero operation.
Define fixed-angle truncation and wrapping without host float-to-short overflow.
Host reciprocal-square-root seeds retain the original Newton refinements but
are not Wii frsqrte bit-pattern emulation; full floating-point/gameplay parity
remains a separate gate. These helpers currently drive the diagnostic camera.

